{"last_link_id": 252, "nodes": [{"outputs": [{"name": "IMAGE", "links": [247, 249, 250], "label": "IMAGE", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "IMAGE"}, {"name": "MASK", "label": "MASK", "type": "MASK", "localized_name": "MASK"}], "color": "#2a363b", "shape": 1, "widgets_values": ["5137ecb1a463752e4a81bfacf679fbd1abaff72ac59dfbf5a4b62afca78e1476.png", "image"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "image"}, "name": "image", "label": "image", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "image"}, {"widget": {"name": "upload"}, "name": "upload", "label": "upload", "type": "IMAGEUPLOAD", "localized_name": "choose file to upload"}], "flags": {"pinned": true}, "type": "LoadImage", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#3f5159", "size": [455.61370849609375, 715.9856567382812], "pos": [-3924.8251953125, -661.668212890625], "id": 4, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "LoadImage"}, "order": 0}, {"outputs": [{"name": "prompt", "links": [], "label": "prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt"}, {"name": "show_help", "label": "show_help", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "show_help"}], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["你是一个家具产品拍摄的高级摄像师，接下来生成 10 条，每条不重复，要保持产品不变的基础上，进行不同的视角更换，景别和角度要配合桌子的摆放姿势和细节。比如第一条可以是中景，直立朝右正面平拍;第二条特写，贴薄纱，倾斜 30 度，微俯 20 度，这样每条的细节、姿势、景别、角度都不同，同时保持格式和原来一致，输出要求也符合，只返回 10条提示词，每条独立成段。"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "prompt"}, "name": "prompt", "label": "prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt"}], "flags": {"collapsed": false}, "type": "CR Prompt Text", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [562.8645629882812, 298.5892639160156], "pos": [-4557.9072265625, -298.9861145019531], "id": 143, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "CR Prompt Text"}, "order": 1}, {"outputs": [{"name": "prompt", "links": [252], "label": "prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt"}, {"name": "show_help", "label": "show_help", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "show_help"}], "color": "#322", "widgets_values": ["你是专注生成套图模特提示词专家，用于生成10个同人物，同场景，同服装，不同的模特照片，需要保持专业性。\n\n任务：根据提供的单张人物图片，生成10个结构化的提示词，要求人物一致性不变，场景不变，服装不变，生成的照片要风格写实，符合专业摄影，光线和原图一致\n\n\n### 提示词生成规则\n获取图片内容，按照整体规则生成合适的提示词；\n\n按以下模板生成10条不重复提示词，每条包含以下部分，同时保证摄影的专业性和观赏性：  \n\n【修改指令】\n\n##修改表情：\n\n示例：\n\n如：魅惑地笑/捂嘴偷笑/平静地笑容等\n要求10个图像都有不同的表情\n\n##修改姿势：\n\n示例：\n\n如：双手叉腰，比心的手势等\n要求10个图像都有不同的动作，动作变化幅度不应很小\n\n\n##修改拍摄景别：\n\n示例\n\n如：特写，中景等\n要求10个图像根据不同动作有合适的拍摄景别\n##修改拍摄角度\n\n示例\n\n如：微俯拍30度，正面拍摄等\n要求10个图像根据不同动作有合适的拍摄角度\n\n\n写实风格，人物轮廓与原图一致，光线柔和无畸变，背景细节保留原图特征。  \n\n\n### 输出要求  \n仅返回10条提示词，每条独立成段，用换行分隔，无其他内容。  \n输出格式：【prompt_1】,【prompt_2】,【prompt_3】...\n\n\n### 示例如下：\n\n【prompt_1】同一角色、服装、场景一致，写实风格，光影一致，仅改表情/姿势/视角：中景拍摄+抿嘴偷笑+眼睛弯弯+双手背后+微俯拍30度，8K\n\n...（共10条）"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "prompt"}, "name": "prompt", "label": "prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt"}], "flags": {"collapsed": false}, "type": "CR Prompt Text", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#533", "size": [561.4937133789062, 302.0163269042969], "pos": [-4557.23291015625, -706.658447265625], "id": 141, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "CR Prompt Text"}, "order": 2}, {"outputs": [{"name": "image_urls", "label": "image_urls", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "image_urls"}], "color": "#2a363b", "shape": 1, "widgets_values": ["ComfyUI"], "inputs": [{"name": "images", "link": 246, "label": "images", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "images"}, {"widget": {"name": "filename_prefix"}, "name": "filename_prefix", "label": "filename_prefix", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "filename_prefix"}], "flags": {"pinned": true}, "type": "SaveImage", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#3f5159", "size": [1283.91552734375, 857.7904663085938], "pos": [-3434.803466796875, -611.0797119140625], "id": 10, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "SaveImage"}, "order": 4}, {"outputs": [{"name": "p0", "links": [246], "label": "p0", "type": "*", "localized_name": "p0"}], "color": "#322", "widgets_values": [""], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "pwd"}, "name":